Error [E0120]: `action` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/function_contract_laundering.jet:2:56
    |
  2 | fn erase(action: fn(Bool) => Int) => fn(Bool) => Int = action
    |                                                        ^^^^^^
 Why: this function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: return a copy: `return ~action;` — or take ownership with the move-capability marker `^`: `action: ^fn(Bool) => Int`. There's no borrow-return in v1 — to share the value without a full copy, store an owned field, or reach for `Shared<T>`/`Id<T>` once a real program needs shared ownership

